# Project Architecture and Module Organization

## Project Overview
Git Metadata Extractor - Extract and enrich repository metadata using AI models for the Imaging Plaza project and Open Pulse initiative.

**Key Collaborators:**
- EPFL Center for Imaging
- Swiss Data Science Center (SDSC)
- EPFL Open Science Office

